---
import CallToAction from './CallToAction.astro';
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
import Community from '../components/Community.astro';
---

<section id="community" class="community-preview">
  <div class="community-content">
    <header class="section-header">
      <p class="section-label">/ Community & Leadership</p>
      <h3>Making an impact beyond engineering</h3>
    </header>

    <div class="community-text">
      <p>
        During my undergraduate years at the University of Moratuwa,
        I was actively involved in the <strong>Rotaract Club</strong>, contributing to
        community initiatives focused on healthcare, education, and
        social well-being.
      </p>

      <p>
        As Co-Chairperson of <strong>Hand in Hand</strong>, we raised <strong>LKR 2,090,500</strong> for the National Cancer Hospital
        in Sri Lanka, earning the <strong>Silver Award</strong> for Most Outstanding Fundraiser in 2018–19. In the following year, as Director of
        the Community Service Avenue, our efforts received the <strong>Gold Award</strong>.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="community-cta">
      <CallToAction href="/community/">
        View More
        <Icon icon="arrow-right" size="1.2em" />
      </CallToAction>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .community-preview {
    padding: 2rem 0;
  }

  .community-content {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .section-header {
    max-width: 50ch;
    color: var(--gray-300);
    font-size: var(--text-md);
  }

  .section-label {
    color: var(--accent-dark);
  }

  .section-header h3 {
    color: var(--gray-100);
    font-size: var(--text-2xl);
  }

  .community-text {
    max-width: 75ch;
    color: var(--gray-300);
    font-size: var(--text-md);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .community-cta {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
  }

  @media (min-width: 50em) {
    .community-content {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 2fr;
      gap: 3rem;
      align-items: start;
    }

    .section-header h3 {
      font-size: var(--text-3xl);
    }

    .community-cta {
      grid-column: 1 / -1;
      justify-content: center;
      margin-top: 1.5rem;
    }
  }
</style>